{"id": "sfusd-immunization-attendance-audits", "title": "School auditors questioned attendance funding over immunization records four years running", "seconds": 47.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.12, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "e398ea191817e197", "words": 153, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "San Francisco Unified’s auditors questioned $124,105 in attendance funding in the latest school audit.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.39, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Which", "attendance", "records", "counted?"], "sub": "San Francisco Unified School District"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.78, 1.26, 1.65, 2.05, 2.21, 2.45, 2.96, 3.36, 3.53, 3.79, 4.07, 4.39, 4.49, 4.88, 5.2, 5.29, 5.39, 5.64, 5.92]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "They found 23 of 120 sampled records out of compliance with immunization requirements.", "t0": 6.51, "t1": 11.06, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "23 of 120", "label": "Sampled pupil records"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.41, 0.99, 1.11, 1.29, 1.53, 1.86, 2.23, 2.54, 2.65, 2.74, 3.21, 3.35, 3.96]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The problem had appeared four years running. The first audit identified six samples with incomplete support.", "t0": 11.28, "t1": 16.27, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy22", "kicker": "FY2022 audit", "text": "Immunizations", "mark": "Immunizations"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.48, 0.59, 0.97, 1.2, 1.45, 2.23, 2.37, 2.63, 2.88, 3.44, 3.66, 4.02, 4.18, 4.6]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The next audit found one of 14 pupils sampled out of compliance.", "t0": 16.39, "t1": 19.42, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy23", "kicker": "FY2023 audit", "text": "Immunizations", "mark": "Immunizations"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.36, 0.62, 0.87, 1.01, 1.1, 1.51, 1.86, 2.22, 2.33, 2.41]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In fiscal 2024 the auditors found 35 out of 120.", "t0": 19.54, "t1": 23.35, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "35 of 120", "label": "The FY2024 sample"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.47, 0.74, 1.35, 1.48, 1.9, 2.17, 2.8, 2.93, 3.04, 3.21, 3.46]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The draft questioned $428,322.", "t0": 23.47, "t1": 26.99, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$428,322", "label": "Earlier draft"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.42, 0.78, 1.01, 1.25, 1.7, 2.13, 2.37, 2.63, 3.1]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The signed report revised that figure to $307,342 after reducing the disallowed attendance.", "t0": 27.11, "t1": 33.29, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$307,342", "label": "Signed FY2024 report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.39, 0.73, 1.1, 1.26, 1.54, 1.64, 1.86, 2.14, 2.43, 2.79, 3.02, 3.28, 3.75, 4.4, 4.75, 5.15, 5.24, 5.66]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]", "established[4]"], "text": "The fiscal 2025 audit still listed the previous corrective action as unimplemented. The district promised periodic checks and follow-up at schools.", "t0": 33.51, "t1": 40.49, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy25", "kicker": "Status of the earlier finding", "text": "Not implemented", "mark": "Not implemented"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.4, 0.65, 1.18, 1.44, 1.66, 1.92, 2.04, 2.4, 2.83, 3.13, 3.26, 4.32, 4.46, 4.79, 5.13, 5.61, 5.9, 6.03, 6.46, 6.55]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The final state adjustment for fiscal 2025 remains open in the available records.", "t0": 40.61, "t1": 44.6, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "items": ["State determination", "Attendance adjustment"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.39, 0.6, 1.03, 1.16, 1.47, 1.72, 2.34, 2.71, 2.95, 3.03, 3.14, 3.57]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 44.72, "t1": 46.61, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.56, 0.71, 0.92, 0.99, 1.08, 1.31, 1.56]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The latest test", "b": "Four years of findings", "o": "The state adjustment"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "document"}